    "Apart from your planned nap, if you cannot stay awake, go to bed early rather than napping late.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apart from your planned nap, if you cannot stay awake, go to bed early rather than napping late."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naast je geplande dutje: als je niet wakker kunt blijven, ga dan vroeg naar bed in plaats van laat te dutten."
          }
        }
      },
      "generatesSymbol": false
    },
    "Apart from your planned nap, if you cannot stay awake, nap for under 30 minutes and be up by :untilUtc; after that, stay up until bed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apart from your planned nap, if you cannot stay awake, nap for under 30 minutes and be up by %1$@; after that, stay up until bed."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naast je geplande dutje: als je niet wakker kunt blijven, doe dan een dutje van minder dan 30 minuten en sta uiterlijk om %1$@ op; blijf daarna op tot bedtijd."
          }
        }
      },
      "generatesSymbol": false
    },
